    "en": "How can retrieval-augmented generation make scientific literature review more complete, verifiable, and reproducible?",
    "zh": "检索增强生成如何让科学文献综述更完整、可核验、可复现？"
  },
  "questions": [
    {
      "id": "Q1",
      "level": "answerable",
      "parent_id": "",
      "en": "Which retrieval methods are used to find evidence for scientific literature review?",
      "zh": "哪些检索方法被用于为科学文献综述寻找证据？",
      "operationalization": "Task: literature review; Method: retrieval/RAG; Data: paper corpora; Metric: recall/coverage; Setting: scientific literature."
    },
    {
      "id": "Q2",
      "level": "answerable",
      "parent_id": "",
      "en": "How is citation faithfulness evaluated in RAG-based literature synthesis?",
      "zh": "在基于 RAG 的文献合成中，引用忠实度如何评估？",
      "operationalization": "Outcome: citation precision/support; Comparator: LLM-only; Data: annotated citation claims; Metric: support rate."
    },
    {
      "id": "Q3",
      "level": "testable",
      "parent_id": "Q1",
      "en": "What evidence exists that multi-source retrieval improves coverage over a single database?",
      "zh": "有哪些证据表明多源检索比单一数据库提高覆盖度？",
      "operationalization": "Compare unique relevant papers retrieved by one vs. multiple sources; measure marginal yield, overlap, and residual misses."
    }
  ],
